        "SHIFT1HOUR": 5
      }
    },
    "PropertiesHelp": "Written by Step 11, in this order. Each entry: ItemId (from GPExplore.vbs, Access must be RW), Value, Type (String, Bool, Int16/32/64, UInt16/32/64, Int8, Byte, Float, Double), Description; optional When (a setting token; written only when it is True), Min/Max. An ItemId with {CELL} is written once per DOC-assigned CNC n (Cell_n). Tokens: {COMPUTERNAME} {SITE} {CNC1}-{CNC3} {DEVICENR1}-{DEVICENR3} {CELL} {CNC} {DEVICENR} and the Settings keys.",
    "Properties": [
      { "ItemId": "Root/Medtronic/Cell_{CELL}/Measurements:SampleCSV_Filepath", "Value": "{SAMPLECSVPATH}", "Type": "String", "Description": "Inspections GP: folder for the BENCH sample CSV" },
